OL,3,GNEWSAJersey cows helping Zambian
OL,4,Afamilies boost incomes
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey cows are helping farming
OL,7,Ffamilies in Zambia earn more money and
OL,8,Fput food on the table, according to
OL,9,FJersey officials preparing to visit the
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,FFarmers, government officials and dairy
OL,13,Fexperts will discuss how the breed is
OL,14,Fhelping improve milk production at the
OL,15,FAfrican Jersey Forum from 13 to 16
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
