OL,3,GNEWSAJersey cows helping Zambian
OL,4,Afamilies boost incomes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Jersey cow, which originated in the
OL,7,FChannel Islands, is known for producing
OL,8,Fhigh-quality milk while needing less
OL,9,Ffeed than many larger breeds and is
OL,10,Fwell suited to hot climates, said
OL,11,FJersey Overseas Aid.
OL,13,FThrough projects funded by the charity,
OL,14,Ffarmers in Zambia have been given
OL,15,Faccess to Jersey cattle, training and
OL,16,Fsupport to help grow their businesses.
